Package: NORMAgene
Type: Package
Title: Data-Driven qRT-PCR Normalization Using NORMAgene
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(
  given="Grant C.",
  family="O'Connell",
  role = c("aut", "cre"),
  email="goconnell.phd@gmail.com",
  comment=c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2642-6670"))
Description: Enables correction for technical variance in raw quantitative reverse
  transcription polymerase chain reaction (qRT-PCR) data using the least
  squares-based NORMAgene data-driven normalization algorithm originally
  described by Heckmann et al. (2011) <doi:10.1186/1471-2105-12-250>.
  Performs normalization of raw crossing threshold values (CT) and also
  calculates relative variability metrics that can be used to assess the impact
  of normalization on variance.
